  "description": "RAQWEP crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group C 2/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C84 H122 Gd6 N16 O26. From the CIF bond table, Gd1 (Gd) has 6 O neighbors; Gd2 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd3 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd1F (Gd) has 6 O neighbors; Gd2F (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd3F (Gd) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 9 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.805-4.013 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 99.67-114.99°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C84H98Gd6N16O26.",
